{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;GunFlare Epoch&quot;</strong> is a dungeon-style top-down shooter roguelike that integrates weapon modification elements. The game features diverse maps, weapons, and modification tools, along with extensive meta-progression and management content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Vast and Varied World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 6 core story maps + 4 optional zones, totaling 10 unique stages for varied challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse rooms &amp; fully destructible maps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/4722c61a73bb5d6e94836d35e7118724.poster.avif?t=1759930809\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/4722c61a73bb5d6e94836d35e7118724.webm?t=1759930809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/4722c61a73bb5d6e94836d35e7118724.mp4?t=1759930809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Weapon Customization Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has its exclusive modification panel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely equip weapon attachments to enhance performance and alter characteristics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons can be evolved to meet stronger performance demands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons can be upgraded automatically when conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/43f3884180feb5497d99e705c0fe64aa.poster.avif?t=1759930809\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/43f3884180feb5497d99e705c0fe64aa.webm?t=1759930809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/43f3884180feb5497d99e705c0fe64aa.mp4?t=1759930809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Item Trading</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, you can trade any items you pick up in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also choose to send items to the lobby for long-term storage, preparing for your next adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/78879317a2bac8351cef2dd77d35c6b8.poster.avif?t=1759930809\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/78879317a2bac8351cef2dd77d35c6b8.webm?t=1759930809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/78879317a2bac8351cef2dd77d35c6b8.mp4?t=1759930809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rogue-Lite Headquarters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive base-building system for persistent upgrades and enhanced gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters also possess unique skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/08f79fa847d64c8b89c32359a64932ab.poster.avif?t=1759930809\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/08f79fa847d64c8b89c32359a64932ab.webm?t=1759930809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/08f79fa847d64c8b89c32359a64932ab.mp4?t=1759930809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Search, Combat, Retreat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Withdraw when weakened, but usually requires defeating the floor boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death leaves behind a safety deposit box with partial resources on the current map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry external items into each run.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829150?t=1759930809","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/1e2ce75493bba2440a875d68b7189886b9cf09d2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759930809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/e754f16681626179f5ccf4c5fde1e65486753ae8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759930809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/e754f16681626179f5ccf4c5fde1e65486753ae8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759930809","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3882590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;GunFlare Epoch&quot;</strong> is a dungeon-style top-down shooter roguelike that integrates weapon modification elements. The game features diverse maps, weapons, and modification tools, along with extensive meta-progression and management content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Vast and Varied World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph